{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36911","headline":"湖上岁暮感怀有寄友人 · 罗隐","name":"湖上岁暮感怀有寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪天萤席几辛勤，同志当时四五人。\n兰版地寒俱[受]露，桂堂风恶独伤春。\n音书久绝应埋玉，编简难言竟委尘。\n唯有广都庞令在，白头罇酒忆交亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}